    <li><a href="https://www.freepressjournal.in/education/iit-bombay-average-salary-hits-rs-2645-lakh-1422-students-placed" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Free Press Journal: IIT Bombay 2024-25 placement figures</a> (page updated 19 May 2026)</li>
    <li><a href="https://news.careers360.com/iit-placements-2024-2025-no-highest-package-data-bombay-delhi-patna-roorkee-crore-salary-btech-jobs-median-average-lowest-aipc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Careers360 News: IITs not disclosing the highest package</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.nirfindia.org/nirfpdfcdn/2025/framework/Colleges.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NIRF 2025 framework for colleges</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.outlookindia.com/national/indias-new-labour-codes-take-effect-all-you-need-to-know" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Outlook India: the labour codes take effect</a> (26 November 2025)</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.weekday.works/post/7-5-lpa-in-hand-salary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Weekday: in-hand pay on a 7.5 LPA CTC</a></li>
  </ul>

